(The ledger's things leaves, batch A - docs/ledger/things-a.md rows
 THG-12, THG-25, THG-34, THG-37, THG-58, THG-64.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself - the
 same reasoning 300_gen_buffers_a.vox gives: these leaves exist to emit
 assertions, and an assertion whose text drifts is an assertion nobody
 is reading.

 'gen reset manifest cycles' stands in for 'gen buffer names reset':
 these leaves spend fresh names from the manifest's own type/field/
 function vocabularies (see gen_things.vox's block comment on the
 batch), so resetting that shared cycle state before each call is what
 makes the draw reproducible here, exactly as it is for a live program.

 Every leaf here is top-level-only by construction - a fresh thing (and,
 for two of them, a fresh plain function) can only be defined at the
 true top level (LANGUAGE.md:931) - so unlike the buffer leaves, there
 is no nested-rendering variant to also exercise.)

Print "--- THG-12: an undefaulted field of each zero-having type ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen reset manifest cycles'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing zero default' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG-12 again, a different order and kinds ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen reset manifest cycles'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing zero default' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG-37: a defaulted float, a defaulted boolean, an undefaulted number ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen reset manifest cycles'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing pinned defaults' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG-25, THG-34: bare declaration, random field defaults ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen reset manifest cycles'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing declaration forms' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG-25, THG-34 again, a different form and field shape ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen reset manifest cycles'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing declaration forms' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG-58: a function receives a copy, the caller is unchanged ---".
'rng seed' of 6.
'gen reset manifest cycles'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing param copy' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- THG-64: a nested thing passed through a chained possessive is copied too ---".
'rng seed' of 7.
'gen reset manifest cycles'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing nested param copy' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- names: no repeat across five type-spending leaves in one run ---".
'rng seed' of 9.
'gen reset manifest cycles'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf thing zero default' of "" and false.
'gen leaf thing pinned defaults' of "" and false.
'gen leaf thing declaration forms' of "" and false.
'gen leaf thing param copy' of "" and false.
'gen leaf thing nested param copy' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
